                        <h2>See your own form running</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-body">
                    <p>The fastest way to judge the fit is to send us a form you already use and watch it become a WhatsApp workflow, with the record landing on a dashboard you control.</p>
                    <p>From there you can decide how the data residency and audit-trail benefits apply to your operation. We can share hosting and processing details so your own privacy review has what it needs.</p>
